{"speciesId":317,"names":{"fr":"Avaltout","es":"Swalot","en":"Swalot","ja":"マルノーム"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"When SWALOT spots prey, it spurts out a hideously toxic fluid from its pores and sprays the target. Once the prey has weakened, this POKéMON gulps it down whole with its cavernous mouth."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"SWALOT has no teeth, so what it eats, it swallows whole, no matter what. Its cavernous mouth yawns widely. An automobile tire could easily fit inside this POKéMON’s mouth."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"Its powerful stomach acid is capable of digesting almost anything. The one thing in the whole world a SWALOT can’t digest is its own stomach."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It can swallow a tire whole in one gulp. It secretes a horribly toxic fluid from the pores on its body."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It can swallow a tire whole in one gulp. It secretes a horribly toxic fluid from the pores on its body."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It swallows anything whole. It sweats toxic fluids from its follicles to douse foes."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It swallows anything whole. It sweats toxic fluids from its follicles to douse foes."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It swallows anything whole. It sweats toxic fluids from its follicles to douse foes."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It gulps anything that fits in its mouth. Its special enzymes can dissolve anything."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It gulps anything that fits in its mouth. Its special enzymes can dissolve anything."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il avale tout en une bouchée. Ses follicules sécrètent des fluides toxiques qui endorment l’ennemi."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It swallows anything whole. It sweats toxic fluids from its follicles to douse foes."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il avale tout en une bouchée. Ses follicules sécrètent des fluides toxiques qui endorment l’ennemi."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It swallows anything whole. It sweats toxic fluids from its follicles to douse foes."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It swallows anything whole. It sweats toxic fluids from its follicles to douse foes."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It swallows anything whole. It sweats toxic fluids from its follicles to douse foes."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il avale tout en une bouchée. Ses follicules sécrètent des fluides toxiques qui endorment l’ennemi."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Se traga cualquier cosa de una pieza. Sus poros segregan fluidos tóxicos que dañan a sus enemigos."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It swallows anything whole. It sweats toxic fluids from its follicles to douse foes."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"なんでも まるのみしてしまう。 毛穴から 猛毒の 体液を 分泌して 敵に 浴びせかける。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il avale tout en une bouchée. Ses sucs digestifs peuvent digérer n’importe quoi."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Se traga todo lo que le quepa en su enorme boca. Sus jugos gástricos pueden digerir cualquier cosa."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It gulps anything that fits in its mouth. Its special enzymes can dissolve anything."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"口に 入る 大きさの ものなら なんでも まる飲み。特殊な 胃液で なんでも 消化する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Lorsqu’Avaltout repère une proie, il libère une substance terriblement toxique de ses pores et en enduit son ennemi pour l’affaiblir. Ce Pokémon peut ensuite l’avaler d’un coup dans sa gigantesque bouche."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Cuando Swalot detecta una presa, echa por los poros, y a borbotones, un fluido tóxico espantoso con el que rocía a su víctima. Una vez que la debilita, se la traga entera gracias a la gigantesca boca que tiene."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"When Swalot spots prey, it spurts out a hideously toxic fluid from its pores and sprays the target. Once the prey has weakened, this Pokémon gulps it down whole with its cavernous mouth."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"獲物を 見つけると 毛穴から 猛毒の 体液を 吹き出して 浴びせかけるぞ。 弱った ところを 大きな 口で ペロリ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Avaltout n’a pas de dents, ce qui le force à tout avaler en une bouchée. Quand il bâille, sa bouche prend une taille impressionnante, et on pourrait y placer une roue de voiture."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Swalot no tiene dientes, así que lo que come se lo traga de una vez; da igual lo que sea. A este Pokémon le cabría un neumático en la boca sin problema."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Swalot has no teeth, so what it eats, it swallows whole, no matter what. Its cavernous mouth yawns widely. An automobile tire could easily fit inside this Pokémon’s mouth."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"歯が １本も ないので なんでも 丸のみ。 いっぱいに 開けた 口は とても 大きく 自動車の タイヤだって すっぽり 入るぞ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":317,"moves":[{"name":"pound","learns":[[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"fire-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"ice-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[10,"tutor",0]]},{"nam